**/node_modules
**/dist
**/dist-dev
**/*.tsbuildinfo
.git
.env
*.md
# Dev-only diagnostic scripts (apps/api/dev-scripts/) and their mock-store
# dependency never need to be in the Docker build context at all - they're
# excluded from tsconfig.build.json already, this just keeps the build
# context itself smaller. See docs/learning-notes.md for why these moved
# out of src/scripts/ in the first place.
**/dev-scripts
mock-store/*
!mock-store/package.json
